  "html": "<p>This series of Quests focuses on the mining of Fizz Rocks, converting them into the infamous FizzStar drink, and the notorious characters who control the Squeakeasies in <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>.  One line begins with <a href=\"/wiki/Suspicious_Whisker_Activity\" title=\"Suspicious Whisker Activity\">Suspicious Whisker Activity</a>.  Another line starts with <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Me_Hubby\" title=\"Find Me Hubby\">Find Me Hubby</a>.  A third starts with <a href=\"/wiki/Digging_Deep\" title=\"Digging Deep\">Digging Deep</a>.\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Fizz Quests\"</h2>\n<p>There are 15 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>B</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Back_on_the_Wagon\" title=\"Back on the Wagon\">Back on the Wagon</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_the_Midnight_Fizz_Rock\" title=\"Burning the Midnight Fizz Rock\">Burning the Midnight Fizz Rock</a></li></ul>\n<h3>D</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Demorale_Majority\" title=\"Demorale Majority\">Demorale Majority</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Digging_Deep\" title=\"Digging Deep\">Digging Deep</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Distilling_the_Truth\" title=\"Distilling the Truth\">Distilling the Truth</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>F</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fizz_Water_Burn\" title=\"Fizz Water Burn\">Fizz Water Burn</a></li></ul>\n<h3>O</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Our_Thing\" title=\"Our Thing\">Our Thing</a></li></ul>\n<h3>P</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Porthole_Science\" title=\"Porthole Science\">Porthole Science</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Proc-rat-inaton\" title=\"Proc-rat-inaton\">Proc-rat-inaton</a></li></ul>\n<h3>R</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Raid_Boss\" title=\"Raid Boss\">Raid Boss</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Rumored_Refining\" title=\"Rumored Refining\">Rumored Refining</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>S</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Squeakeasys\" title=\"Squeakeasys\">Squeakeasys</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Suspicious_Whisker_Activity\" title=\"Suspicious Whisker Activity\">Suspicious Whisker Activity</a></li></ul>\n<h3>T</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Take_Out_Orders\" title=\"Take Out Orders\">Take Out Orders</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Taking_Down_Capwn\" title=\"Taking Down Capwn\">Taking Down Capwn</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n</tr></table>\n</div>\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
